  "question": {
    "text": "A s-block element (M) reacts with oxygen to form an oxide of the formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The oxide is pale yellow in colour and paramagnetic. The element&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is:"
